Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.79,Bottom,,0,0,0,,This is needle seagrass, Halodule pinifolia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.01,0:00:05.42,Bottom,,0,0,0,,A display, not a scan of a meadow in Mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:08.65,Bottom,,0,0,0,,Each leaf is fine, with one dark vein down the centre.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:10.47,Bottom,,0,0,0,,Watch the tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.75,0:00:14.14,Bottom,,0,0,0,,That vein splits in two, and the tip stays rounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.46,0:00:19.69,Bottom,,0,0,0,,That rounded tip is how you tell it from the other needle seagrass,\NHalodule uninervis, whose tip is a trident.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.07,0:00:23.24,Bottom,,0,0,0,,The rhizome is usually pale, with clean black leaf scars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.42,0:00:26.00,Bottom,,0,0,0,,The patch spreads when the buried stem grows through the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:27.82,Bottom,,0,0,0,,Roots grow down at each node.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:29.90,Bottom,,0,0,0,,It can also flower and set seed.
